- * Example:
- * Assume A -> B (A imports B), A => C (A dynamically imports C) and C -> B.
- * Then the initial algorithm would assign A into the A chunk, C into the C
- * chunk and B into the AC chunk, i.e. the chunk with the dependent entry
- * points A and C.
